ta-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricIsometricEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricIsometricEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}isometric\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricIsometricEmbedding}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))=d_X(x,y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}isometric\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricIsometricEmbedding}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))=d_X(x,y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]